<title>UK: Imperial year profit rises to 366 mln stg.</title>
<headline>Imperial year profit rises to 366 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to September 28, 1996</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> PBIT			 366		    vs 348</p>
<p> Turnover		   3.82 bln	     vs 3.57 bln</p>
<p>NOTE - Imperial Tobacco Group Plc said it will pay an interim dividend in August 1997 and a final dividend in February 1998, in the proportions of one third and two thirds of the total annual dividend.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
